{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2016-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1467936000, "end_date": 1468627199, "month_true_total": 1255, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:54:40 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "24343323", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118067028", "personaname": "Wielebny Gorzauka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198118067028/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 235325, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1156, "playtime_at_review": 6641, "last_played": 1789410577, "avatar": "ac96a1f994560b9a1f4bd90fd6c4f8c51a7513c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good dynamic game highly addictiv and satisfying...", "timestamp_created": 1468624462, "timestamp_updated": 1468624462, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49773755669593811", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24342675", "author": {"steamid": "76561198100577143", "personaname": "Bamallamadingdong", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thisisnottheurlyourelookingfor/", "num_games_owned": 3127, "num_reviews": 73, "playtime_forever": 241363, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 24115, "last_played": 1786890548, "avatar": "f862b20551eab4b34dfa89cf87cb0010869b7984"}, "language": "english", "review": "My friends have staged several interventions to get me off this game.\n\nUnfortunately I've been too busy playing to go to any of them.", "timestamp_created": 1468621414, "timestamp_updated": 1486202383, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49773755669593811", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24341919", "author": {"steamid": "76561198207233227", "personaname": "Solid Naked Snake", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198207233227/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 8213, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3033, "last_played": 1685495838, "avatar": "d574ea26831b5fb9a05985ed5a23aa5c158f4b2d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warframe is a third person shooter that puts a heavy emphasis on mobility. It is very fast paced and very fun. It has fairly low requirements to run and usually runs pretty smoothly. There are dozens of different Warframes to choose from, all offering different play styles and abilities.\n\nPros: \nEverything can be aquired through the game's currency with the acception of asthetics and extra slots for weapons and warframes (basically classes like in an RPG)\n\nCombat is fluid and feels great.\n\nThere is a very wide variety of weapons and Warframes and even more advanced versions of existing warframes.\nthere is an in depth trading system that can work very well with the player market so that you can get some of the game's real money currency without having to spend any money.\n\nCons:\nThe game can get repetative sometimes, forcing you to farm for hours on end to level up your equipment and get new mods to enhance said equipment.\n\nThere are noticable difficulty spikes at times where enemies will one-shot you, forcing you to grind more\n\nYou are giveen a small amount of the real life equivelent to money (I highly recommend that you buy additional warframe slots and weapon slots with it).\n\nThe game can feel at times to be slightly pay-to-win.", "timestamp_created": 1468618406, "timestamp_updated": 1468618406, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24341861", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039851069", "personaname": "SHARP13GAM3Z", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039851069/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1671, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1038, "last_played": 1479572215, "avatar": "29413bbbab009d46250e0bf7c61c940b35cc57c9"}, "language": "english", "review": "one of the best games that I have ever played it is a beautiful highly suggest if you like TPS games and has really good controls", "timestamp_created": 1468618144, "timestamp_updated": 1468618144, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24341652", "author": {"steamid": "76561198187650774", "personaname": "MoonMann", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TermianTor/", "num_games_owned": 170, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 154907, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 172, "playtime_at_review": 55663, "last_played": 1789061354, "avatar": "0328e64c4b84c5aab3ae7dbfb6a09d0e2ce3c869"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is the grind. There is a reason people call it Warfarm. If you have the time and passion (and patience) then go for it. The developers actually listen to their fanbase. The playerbase is active and helpful.", "timestamp_created": 1468617337, "timestamp_updated": 1649551030, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase":